              "id": "text-28",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "As your foremost Global Metal Supplier, Titanium Industries stands as your most trusted partner in the industry. With over 50 years of experience, we specialize in providing specialty metals and solutions for the Aerospace, Defense, Industrial, Medical, and Oil & Gas markets. Holding the world’s most complete inventory of Titanium Round & Rectangle Bar, Plate, Sheet, Pipe & Fittings, and other specialty metals across a global service center network, T.I. delivers supply solutions at all levels of sophistication and complexity. With a globally experienced and technically driven team, T.I. has been providing dependable, quality-driven service to our customers since 1972. Trust Titanium Industries as your go-to Global Metal Supplier for all your metal supply needs."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
